<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Greyhound year net loss widens.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Greyhound year net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.66 vs 3.15</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 7.69 vs loss 3.51</p>
<p>    Sales				   73.81 vs 81.40</p>
<p>    Other income			   3.69 vs 1.31</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		    loss 34.69 vs loss 5.60</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 8.35 vs loss 6.69</p>
<p>    Tax					 nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.22 vs 1.78</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.67 vs 4.30</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Greyhound Pioneer Australia Ltd is a coach-line operator.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
